  "id": "seasonal-variation",
  "term": "seasonal variation",
  "definition": "Seasonal variation is change across the seasons of the year in environmental conditions or in how strongly related outcomes and interactions occur. In the source, it refers to shifts from summer to winter in factors such as temperature, food availability, and physical stress, with corresponding changes in behavior, growth, and survival.",
